    "details": {
      "description": "<p><span style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre-wrap\"><strong style=\"font-weight:normal\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-086be5c0-7fff-773a-f58a-4a9903ae8a16\">An orb containing brilliant white light rests atop an altar.</strong></span></p>",
      "disable": "<p>@Check[arcana|dc:38|traits:action:disable-a-device]{Arcana}, @Check[crafting|dc:38|traits:action:disable-a-device]{Crafting}, @Check[religion|dc:38|traits:action:disable-a-device]{Religion}, @Check[thievery|dc:38|traits:action:disable-a-device]{Thievery}.<br>3 Successes are required to disable this hazard. Each success reduces the number of actions in the routine by 1 (Critical Successes count as 2).</p>",
      "isComplex": true,
      "level": {
        "value": 14
      },
      "publication": {
        "authors": "Locke",
        "license": "ORC",
        "remaster": true,
        "title": "Covalon - Briarmurk"
      },
      "reset": "<p>The orb is dormant for 24 hours.</p>",
      "routine": "<p>(3 actions) The hazard spends each of its actions on Bloody Wrath. It prioritizes the closest enemy to it that it has not already struck this round and will not strike the same create twice each round. The hazard does not increment MAP.</p>"
